// MCQs

::Spark-RDD::
Which of the following operation output return type can be different from the input type?{
    = aggregateByKey()
    ~ reduceByKey()
    ~ groupByKey()
    ~ countByKey()
}


::Spark-RDD::
Which function applies the map function on the values of the keys without changing the keys?{
    ~ map()
    ~ keys()
    ~ values()
    = mapValues()
}
